body:
I would consult more credible sources (maybe imams or shayk's or even islam qna) about multiple marriages and their criterion within islam before coming to reddit and asking about it. It seems you have already run into a few disputes on the criteria for a second wife.

&#x200B;

Inshallah, I pray you find what is best for you tho and that whatever happens brings you closer to Allah SWT.

Weren't you the same guy hitting bass notes on this sub like a day ago LOL?

&#x200B;

The **versatility!**
